---
type: readme
title: Stable media Mojo API overview
summary: Explains that this directory holds the stable Mojo API Chrome uses to talk to other processes such as ARC for video decoding.
---

This directory contains the Mojo API used by Chrome to communicate with
other processes, like ARC, for video decoding.
This API is stable order to provide a safe communication between independent
version-skewed binaries and should only be used for the mentioned purposes.
